@startuml Checkout_Transaksi
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Checkout / Transaksi (Checkout Process)
actor Customer
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB
participant "Payment\nGateway" as Payment

Customer -> App: Klik Checkout dari Cart
App -> API: GET /api/cart
API -> DB: Query Item Cart
DB --> API: Return Cart Items
API --> App: Response Cart Data
App --> Customer: Tampilkan Cart Review\n(Item, Total, Alamat)

Customer -> App: Input/Pilih Alamat Pengiriman
Customer -> App: Pilih Metode Pembayaran
Customer -> App: (Optional) Masukkan Kode Voucher

alt Ada Voucher
    App -> API: POST /api/voucher/validate
    API -> DB: Check Voucher Validity
    DB --> API: Voucher Valid/Reward
    API --> App: Return Diskon Amount
    App -> App: Update Total Harga
end

App -> App: Calculate Final Total (Harga + Ongkir - Diskon)
App --> Customer: Tampilkan Final Total

Customer -> App: Klik Lanjutkan Pembayaran
App -> API: POST /api/orders
note right of App
    Request Body:
    - customer_id
    - items[]
    - delivery_address
    - payment_method
    - discount (if any)
    - total_amount
end note

API -> DB: Create Order Record
DB --> API: Order ID Generated
API -> DB: Insert Order Items
API -> DB: Clear/Archive Cart
DB --> API: Success
API --> App: Response (Order ID, Payment Token)

alt Payment Method: Transfer Bank/Card
    App -> Payment: Initialize Payment
    Payment --> App: Payment Token/URL
    App --> Customer: Redirect ke Payment Gateway
    Customer -> Payment: Input Payment Details
    Payment -> Payment: Process Payment
    Payment --> App: Payment Webhook Notification
    App -> API: PUT /api/orders/{id}/confirm-payment
    API -> DB: Update Order Status = PAID
    DB --> API: Success
    API --> App: Response Success
    App --> Customer: Tampilkan Payment Success Page\n(Order ID, Receipt)
else Payment Method: COD
    API -> DB: Set Order Status = PENDING_PAYMENT
    DB --> API: Success
    API --> App: Response COD Confirmed
    App --> Customer: Tampilkan Order Confirmation\n(Tunggu Konfirmasi Kurir)
end

@enduml